title: "ARES — Automated Red-team Exploit System"
abstract: >-
  ARES is a semi-automated, AI-assisted penetration testing platform that
  orchestrates Metasploit through local large language models for automated
  security auditing, separating LLM-based decision-making from exploit
  execution.
type: software
authors:
